window.products.push({"id":275047,"name":"Beauty Kate Weighted Blanket with Removable Cover | 20 lbs | 60\" x80”| with Premium Glass Beads for Kids & Adults | Cotton/Minky | Darkgrey/Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hOoRPdepL._AC_SL1346_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL🌺The Inner Layer Of Beauty Kate Weighted Blanket Is Made Of 100% Breathable Natural Cotton And Sewn Into Double Row Small Squares. Each Compartment Will Be Filled With Tiny/Non-Toxic/Odorless/Hypo-Allergenic And High Density Plastic Poly Pellets So That The Weight Of The Blanket Will Be Evenly Distributed, Which Can Offer A Better Comfort To You And Prevent Movement While You're Resting. COMPLETE SET! MINKY COVER INCLUDED🌺Each Comforter Comes With A Premium Removable Minky Duvet Cover, Which Is Secured With 8 String Ties Along The Perimeter of The Blanket. The Cover Is Also Suitable For Ordinary Quilt. Use the cover for added warmth during the winter, and remove it to keep cool in the summer. It Can Effectively Protect, Make Cleaning Easier And Increase The Service Life Of The Weighted Blanket. WHAT CAN WEIGHTED BLANKET BRING TO YOU🌺Assisting Adults And Kids To The Deep/Healthy/Restful Sleep By Offering The Gentle Feeling Of Being Held Or Hugged. Comparing With Common Heavy Blanket, The Weighted Blanket Is More Close-Fitting To Body Shape And More Adaptive To Any Sleeping Posture. To prevent the glass beads leakage, we added two layers microfiber inside, which is also breathable and designed to offer better temperature control. CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE YOU NEED🌺The Weight Of Blankets Should Be Better 10%-12% Of Your Body Weight To Help You Sleep Better And Fall Asleep Longer. Please Choose The Weight Depending On Individual Preference. 10% Of Body Weight Is Recommended. 20 lbs Is Suitable For 190-240 lbs Individual. We Recommend 60''x80'' For Queen Bed, Full Bed And King Size Bed. Please Note, A Weighted Blanket Would Be Smaller Than Same Size Regular Blanket As It Is Supposed To Cover Your Body Other Than Your bed. Quality & Customer Guarantee🌺We Have Professional QC Team. The QC Team Would Check The Blanket From Step To Step During The Manufacturing. If There Is Any Defect, We Would Fix The Problem Or Pick It Out. We Offer 24-Hour Professional Customer Service, If You Have Any Problems, Please Just Feel Free To Contact Us. Beauty Kate Offers 30 Days Unconditional Money Back Guarantee & Lifetime After Sale Service.</br>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hOoRPdepL._AC_SL1346_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beauty Kate","source_asin":"B07MVB824Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MVB824Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MVB824Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
