window.products.push({"id":275144,"name":"JETPRINT Pretty High Degree Coffee Mug, Funny Gift for Ph.D. Students - 11 oz - Ceramic - Phd Graduation Gifts for Men, Women, Student","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cc5ukatfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️PERFECT SIZE COFFEE MUG - Holds 11 oz of your Favorite Hot & Cold Beverage – 100% Pure Finest Ceramic. Coffee is never really coffee unless it’s in your favorite mug. Best size for your best drinks. Great friends deserves great size coffee mug gifts. Perfectly shaped handle and curved rim allow you to hold the mug and use it with ease and comfort 🎁GREAT GIFT - Perfect and ideal gift idea for men and women coffee and tea lover friends, family members, male of female office co-workers, It will be an awesome funny present for your mom, dad, son, daughter, brother, sister, boyfriend, girlfriend, husband, wife, grandpa, grandma, grandson or granddaughter, for their birthday, graduation, anniversary, or Christmas, Valentine’s Day, Hanukkah, Easter celebration. Great novelty for a humorous joke or a funny saying, great conversation starter ☕DISHWASHER AND MICROWAVE SAFE - High Quality and Long-Life Front and Back Sided Printing by Using Non-Toxic Sublimation Materials. The Best and Finest Ceramic is used and designs are printed in 1400 degrees in order to make your mug long lasting and resistant to any scratching and fading. It is both Dishwasher and Microwave Safe, feel free to wash and drink from your cup. 🚚SAFE, FAST and FREE SHIPPING, PACKAGED WITH CARE ✔️ Your Mugs are Nicely Packaged and Shipped Immediately. Fast Delivery is Crucial for Us. We know that your gift is special, this is why we do everything to make it arrives to you in perfect way. Each of your order is individually crafted with the best quality ceramic hand-packed with love, care and attention. 🏆100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Contact us and let us know if you have any concern about our mugs. We are 100% sure that everyone will love our coffee mugs! If you are unhappy in any way, just return our mugs for a 100% refund - no question asked because your happiness is always our #1 priority","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cc5ukatfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JETPRINT","source_asin":"B07CN76Q3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CN76Q3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CN76Q3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
