window.products.push({"id":275324,"name":"EFLYING 2 Pack Wide Mouth 24oz Mason Jars Drinking Glasses Mason Jar Cups with Bamboo Lids White Silicone Sleeve Covers and Silver Straws Reusable Smo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kna3W0xIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹【Environmental Friendly & Reusable】The reusable smoothie cups with bamboo lids and stainless steel straws can replace the disposable plastic boba cups and plastic straws we encounter on daily basis. Let alone using at home, these mason jars are also great as take out boba cup and coffee to go cup. Our 24 oz mason jars wide mouth set comes with 2 mason jar drinking glasses, 2 bamboo lids with white silicone sleeves, 2 silver stainless steel straws, a jar brush and a straw brush. 🍹【Upgrade Eco Bamboo Lids with Silicone Sleeve Covers】Our reusable bamboo mason jar lids for mason jars have a new full covering detachable silicone sleeve design. The service life of the bamboo lids is highly extended with this silicone cover design, also strengthening the lid sealing performance, help ensuring the lids of 24oz wide mouth mason jars are tightly sealed and preventing water leakages better. 🍹【Perfect for Cold Beverages & Warm Drinks】Our mason jar set comes with 2 silver stainless steel boba straws with a 1.2cm/ 0.5inch diameter strawhole, the thick straw size allow dense beverages such as smoothies, slushies, yogurt to easily come through. Extra drink ingredients such as boba pearls, puddings, red beans and small fruit flesh pieces can also come through from the straws. Wide mouth mason jar can be use for tea, coffee, juice, milkshakes, detox water, cocktails and other drinks. 🍹【Easy to Keep Clean】Our 24oz wide mouth mason jars are made of high quality, sturdy, thick glass which has a smooth interior that will not absorb food, coloring or odors. Natural bamboo lids with silicone sleeves can prevent rust and deformation, all materials are BPA and PVC free and meet food safety standards. The silicone sleeves can be detached from the bamboo lids with strawholes easily. After using, please detach and clean the parts separately and keep dry to avoid mildew. 🍹【Large Capacity & Wide Mouth Caliber】These mason jar drinking cups have a capacity of 24 ounces, which is big enough to hold more drinks at once. The bottle mouth caliber is a wide mouth of 3.2 inches diameter, it is convenient to make your own drinks with fruit flesh slices or other ingredients such as boba pearls, also it is large enough for you to clean the interior glasses with the included jar brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kna3W0xIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EFLYING","source_asin":"B09PYHKYZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PYHKYZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PYHKYZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
