window.products.push({"id":275348,"name":"Everlasting Silk Flowers Cemetery Vase with Stakes-Plastic Flower Vases with 2 Ground Spikes, Draining Holes - for Garden, Lawn, Yard - Memorial Grave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pjXlnVxVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Laying flowers on the resting place of our dear departed is quite a thoughtful way to pay your respects. Losing a friend or a family member is never easy. It’s a heartbreaking experience that we only learn to come to terms with in time. For many of us, one way of coping with our pain and grief is by making sure to honor the memory of our loved ones. One of the most sincere ways of paying our respects is by offering beautiful flowers. It’s a way to show our enduring love for the family or friend we’ve lost, while also making sure that their final resting place is still bursting with life in the form of breathtaking bouquets or simple floral arrangements. Show your love and sympathy with the Everlasting Silk Flowers Cemetery Vase With Stakes. Honor the memory of your dear departed with flowers. Our flower vase is available in Grey Granite, Black Granite, and Cross with Heart designs that will look beautiful on any memorial site. Use it to hold gorgeous artificial or fresh flowers every week. Each flower holder has two individual stakes at the bottom, ensuring that it doesn’t fall or tip over when the wind blows. Simply push the spikes firmly into the ground to keep the vase steady. The pot also has drainage holes to prevent fresh flowers and foliage from getting overwatered. No matter the weather, you’ll be able to use this vase without trouble. Each one is made with thick 49% Polyrisen and 51% Natural Stone powder that won't easily break, warp, crack. You also won't need to replace them every so often. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons you should get this vase: ✅ Wobble-free, sturdy base ✅ Premium, durable construction ✅ Can be used outdoors at the cemetery or in your garden or yard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pjXlnVxVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everlasting Silk Flowers","source_asin":"B0916KJTNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916KJTNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916KJTNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
