window.products.push({"id":275404,"name":"Kitchen Craft Colourworks 5 Piece Measuring Spoon Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wU5CsKNNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why rely on guesswork? The Kitchen Craft Colourworks Five Piece Measuring Spoon Set features everything you need to accurately measure out sugar, salt, herbs and spices for your favourite recipes. It features five clearly marked spoons, enabling you to easily measure out a quarter of teaspoon, half a teaspoon, a teaspoon, half a tablespoon and a tablespoon. Each measuring spoon is also marked with its metric equivalent capacity (in millilitres), so you can closely follow all kinds of recipes. The set is colour coded in the key Colourworks shades too, so you can quickly grab the one you need. Stain resistant, you can use them to measure the strongest of spices, like turmeric and saffron. They won’t stain. As soon as you pop them in your dishwasher or rinse them by hand, any strong colours simply wash away. What’s more, the set also comes with a five year guarantee! Part of the Kitchen Craft Colourworks range, mix and match the Five Piece Measuring Spoon with hundreds of kitchen tools and accessories in purple, green, pink, orange and blue, as well as six other gorgeous shades. About Colourworks The perfect blend of vibrancy and practicality, the Colourworks range by Kitchen Craft features more than 400 essential kitchen tools, gadgets, knives and accessories in 11 vibrant colours. Don't let the fun colours fool you, this is seriously high performance kitchen kit, designed to deliver incredible reliability on a daily basis. Using a variety of materials across the whole collection, including flexible LFGB grade, food-safe silicone, strong stainless steel, virtually unbreakable melamine and durable nylon, each product in our range provides fantastic performance whatever the cooking task.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wU5CsKNNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Craft","source_asin":"B003SZU66W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003SZU66W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003SZU66W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
