window.products.push({"id":275519,"name":"Now Designs Spectrum Cushion, Turquoise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91k7SKhs92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Available in an array of solid, vibrant colors, the Spectrum Cushion by Now Designs will be a wonderful addition to your living room or bedroom. Its simple design boasts a three button closure and same-color piping. The heavy-duty cotton exterior is completely removable and machine washable. The fluffy polyester pillow insert is included. Add Spectrum pillows to your bed, sofa, chairs or couches. Durable and chic, the Spectrum Cushion is a wonderful value and a fun way to add a pop of color to your existing decor. Cushion measures 17 by 17-inch. Amazon.com Now Designs Spectrum Solids Now Designs has been creating beautiful and functional kitchen textiles and table linens for over 40 years. We design high quality napkins, placemats, runners and tablecloths in a wide selection of colors and patterns. At Now Designs we take color seriously! We share a love and passion for color. Our mission is to bring color to your home. Add color to your table with our Spectrum collection of 100% cotton solid color table linens in sixteen bright, beautiful colors. We invite you to mix, match and use your creativity and imagination to color your table to reflect your style. Spectrum Solid Placemats Our woven ribbed placemats add some classic texture to the table and roll up easily for storage. Placemat size is 13 x 19\" - 33 x 48cm. Spectrum Solid Napkins These napkins add simple, classic style and color to everyday meals, picnics or special occasions. Napkin size is 19 x 19\" - 48 x 48cm. Spectrum Solid Tablecloths This classic range of tablecloths is the starting point for any table setting, whether casual or formal. Because they are 100% cotton minor shrinkage is to be expected after washing. Tablecloths are available in six sizes: Spectrum Solid Chair Pads Tie on an extra layer of colorful comfort to every meal. These cushy pads feature a polyfill interior and 100% cotton outer with handy ties to keep the pad in place. Chair Pad size is 15 x 15\" - 38 x 38cm. Spectrum Cushions These finely ribbed cotton cushions feature a classic button closure, piping trim and removable polyester fill. Cushion size is 17 x 17\" - 43 x 43cm. Education without Borders A percentage of the profit on the sales of Now Designs product lines go to Education without Borders. The objective of the foundation is to foster educational opportunities and provide educational facilities in disadvantaged regions of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91k7SKhs92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B009CV5U8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009CV5U8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009CV5U8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
