window.products.push({"id":275526,"name":"Pizzacraft PC6021 Pizza Oven Wood Pellet Smoker and Shovel,Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZMdhOsHsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you want to add rich wood smoke flavor to pizzas cooked on your portable pizza oven, this smoker box and pellet shovel set will let you do so with ease! Install and fill your smoker box in moments, then cook your pizzas in a smoky, flavorful environment. The included pellet shovel reaches back into the oven so you can refill your smoker without removing the oven hood, and collapses for easy storage. HOW TO USE: Remove the hood and top stone from your pizza oven. Align the indent in the bottom of the smoker with the back tab in the oven body and place the smoker on top of the bottom stone. Replace the top stone; it will hold the bottom of the smoker in place and keep it in position. Use your shovel to place 2-3 scoops of wood pellets into the reservoir created by the smoker and the stone. Replace the hood and cook as normal. If you need to refill your smoker, use your shovel to place more pellets in the smoker. CARE: Wait for smoker to cool before washing. Do not use abrasive scrubbers. Dishwasher safe. CAUTION: Smoker will get hot during use. Use heat-safe gloves when handling. Do not leave oven unattended. The Pizzacraft Pizza Oven Wood Pellet Smoker and Shovel is one of several accessories which complement the Pizzeria Pronto and PizzaQue Outdoor Pizza Ovens. The Pizzacraft Pizza Oven Accessories/Folding Peel & Stone Brush - PC0217 helps you transfer your pizzas easily and keep your oven clean. The Pizzacraft Pizza Oven Leg Kit - PC6011 lifts your pizza oven to about 3.3 feet from the ground, which makes it easy to get pizzas in and out of your oven, while the Pizzacraft Pizza Oven Side Table - PC6026 provides a convenient and durable workspace right next to your oven. There are two pizza oven covers which protect your oven in all conditions -- the Pizzacraft Pizza Oven Protective Cover, Long - PC6019 and the Pizzacraft Pizza Oven Protective Cover - PC6012. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED. Pizzacraft is here to help if you have any concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZMdhOsHsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pizzacraft","source_asin":"B00RWSYGU8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RWSYGU8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RWSYGU8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
