window.products.push({"id":275530,"name":"Jerrybox Travel Neck Pillow Fastest Inflatable Pillow with 2 Airbags, Soft Neck Support Pillow for Airplanes with Packsack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918isj2dS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jerrybox cervical pillow is with dual airbags design, you can inflate out, not only to your desired firmness, but also by inflating it more of less, you can also determine the height of the pillow, adjusting your neck for the most comfortable angle for sleeping and breathing. For the friends who has problems with his / her spine, just ask your doctor if this would be right for you? The First Dual Airbags Travel Pillow We are proud to announce that our travel pillow is the first dual airbag travel pillow on the market. Dual airbag means that you can press the two discreet round buttons to inflate the pillow in just 10 seconds (the fastest speed), which is 5 times faster than a single airbag pillow. Say goodbye to the embarrassment of blowing your pillow up by mouth. To deflate, just press and hold the air valve to let the air out. Contoured Shape for the Best Support Molded to follow the contours of your neck and shoulders, the travel pillow features two back humps to properly support your neck and head during long trips. Another aspect of the product is that it can be worn inversely since the two front bump buttons ingeniously support your head too. Wear it whichever way feels best according to your preference. Soft and Compact The cover is made of soft and lightweight velvet, making the pillow extremely comfortable to use. It can be removed and washed for easy maintenance. The pillow is also compact in size when deflated and folded. Take it along while traveling without adding any bulk to your luggage. Notes Before wash the pillow, take out the gasbag inside and just wash the velvet cover by hand or by washing machine (cool or warm water) and let it air dry. Do not wash the inner tube or expose to direct sunlight. Warranty 30 DAYS MONEY BACK AND 18 MONTHS REPLACEMENT. JUST BUY IT WITH NO RISK.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918isj2dS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jerrybox","source_asin":"B06XW314DB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XW314DB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XW314DB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
