window.products.push({"id":275751,"name":"Stanley Utility Drink-Thru Plastic Mug - 16ounce/ .47 Liter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JsFz2L-mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stanley® Utility line For the Tough Commutes to Long Days Solid and practical, the Stanley Utility collection works from tough commutes to long days at work. Whether laboring for steady paychecks or ticking off weekend tasks in foul weather, these mugs and bottles are made to get the job done. All Utility products are BPA-free and come with a 5-year Warranty. Sized for standard American cup holders, this double wall mug insulates tall coffees in drip or shot form. The simple drink-thru lid turns left to open and right to close, eliminating the need to screw around for that first sip. Since 1913, we have been delivering superior food and beverage gear for rugged, active lifestyles and remain dedicated to this simple promise: buy STANLEY products, get quality gear. Building quality products that last is why we’re still around nearly 100 years later. You expect the best and we deliver the best. All Stanley Utility products come with a five year warranty to protect your investment for years to come. Item number: 10-01189-001","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JsFz2L-mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stanley","source_asin":"B00518GQYK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00518GQYK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00518GQYK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":275752,"name":"Silent Hill- Video Game Inspired Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AO+ov7VoS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beware this small town buried in the woods. You never know what you will find hidden deep within the fog. Rumors tell of creatures the likes of which your worst nightmare couldn’t dream up. Did… did you hear that? It sounds as though someone is dragging steel across the ground. You need to go. Escape the fog. Don’t let the chilling fog or the scent of these haunted woods paralyze you. This scent is comprised of notes of Bergamot, Geranium and Lavender upon a bed of Oaky Moss, Amber and Musk. Hi, I’m Chris. Thanks for visiting Game Worlds Illuminated! I’m a gamer who loves being as immersed as possible into the worlds I’m exploring. True immersion requires involving as many senses as possible and one day I started to wonder “What would this environment smell like…?” And thus, Game Worlds Illuminated was born. These candles use custom fragrance combinations to achieve a truly unique scent that you will only find here. All of these candles are mixed and poured by hand in small batches. The key to maximizing your experience with this candle is to ensure the wick is trimmed to 1/4” above the candle surface before burning. This will ensure an even burn across the whole candle and the longest possible life span. A larger flame will burn at a higher temperature and cause the wax to melt quickly and unevenly. These candles are a Soy and Vegetable wax with a custom fragrance mixture. Limit candle burning to four hours or less and burn on a flat surface away from children, pets or flammable materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AO+ov7VoS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B0981TT8NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0981TT8NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0981TT8NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
