window.products.push({"id":275775,"name":"IMPRESA [20 Pack] Espresso Machine Descaler Tablets to Remove Mineral Build Up Descaling Tablets intended for Breville, Jura, Miele, and Other Espress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VCebzI-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Descale Your Espresso Maker -- Over time, mineral deposits can clog your machine's valves, leading to inefficiency or damage. Our espresso descaler tablets will help to decalcify your machine to keep everything running smoothly Universal Use -- Impresa cleaning inserts are intended for Breville descaler, Jura descaling tablets, and Miele descaling tablets usage. Our inserts are also compatible with Bosch Tassimo, Nespresso, Verismo, and virtually all other espresso & coffee makers Better Tasting Coffee -- Limescale in your machine can ruin the flavor of your espresso. Use our descale tablets to clear mineral build-up from the valves. Savor the freshest tasting cup of espresso - every time Simple Process -- Use our descale espresso tablet to easily decalcify your machine. Just follow manufacturer instructions. Descale your espresso maker multiple times with our pack of 20 tablets Extends Life of Your Machine - Using decalcifying espresso tabs regularly will help prevent clogs, breaks, and other damages. This should extend the life of your machine. Enjoy your espresso maker for years to come!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VCebzI-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMPRESA","source_asin":"B08R6PBTDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6PBTDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6PBTDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":275776,"name":"NBCT Facial Anti-Wrinkle Strips, Smoothing and Lifting Forehead Wrinkle Patches, Medium Size, 5 pcs, Silicone Hydrogel Patch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hitfegN9L._SL1001_.jpg","description":"NBCT Forehead Patch - The most effective anti-aging solution, effectively provides the necessary nutrients and care to the forehead and area between the eyes without the need or hassle of other wrinkle care methods, like surgery. NBCT Forehead Patch is an easy yet effective method to reverse deep expression lines. Repairs wrinkle-damaged skin without the dangers of Botox or other injections. Dramatically reduces lines and wrinkles safely and naturally. Hypo-allergenic, no additives, won’t fall off. Trains the underlying facial muscles to regain the strength and tone they have lost. Can be used day or night; leave on for at least an hour and up to 10 hours for best results. Provides continuous moisture: contains 80% moisture for constant moisturization. Reduces fine lines and wrinkles caused by side sleeping or aging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hitfegN9L._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NBCT","source_asin":"B00WSWNHOY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WSWNHOY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WSWNHOY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":275777,"name":"PUMPKIN LOLLY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b7Kk0XsrL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b7Kk0XsrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJRA6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJRA6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJRA6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
