window.products.push({"id":275788,"name":"100PCS Pampas Grass Home Decor - 15.7” Pompas Grass for Dried Floral Arrangements, Fluffy White & Brown Pampas Grass, Pampas Grass with Burlap Lace, D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vHVSiyd6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100PCS Boho Room Decor Pack] This pampass grass bouquet set is composed of 8 types of plants with approximate height of 15.74 inches, including 15pcs white pampas grass, 15pcs natural pampas, 10pcs white bunny tails, 15pcs dried wheat stalks, 35pcs natural reed grass, 2pcs green eucalyptus, 2pcs brown decorative plumes and 4-5pcs dried strawberry flowers. Attached are 1pc burlap lace of 39.37 inches and 1pc hemp rope of 28.87 ft. Suitable for any type of vases. [Premium & Non-toxic] The bohemian decor is made of 100% natural dried pampas grass, which are lightweight and soft to touch. All pompous grass usually will not decay and fade as season changes. The white and natural colored tall dried pampas grass are handled with harmless dehydration, so it is normal that you will smell slight odor when first unwrapping. We suggest you put them in the ventilated place for several days before use. [Widely Used Neutral Home Decor] The various brunches of boho home decorations can be combined with different type of bouquets, which meets your different needs at your Boho living room decor, Boho master bedroom decor, bathroom counter decor, and other places. Compatible for Boho chic wedding decor, baby shower decorations, birthday celebration, or other ceremonial occasion. [Perfect Gift] Our beautiful bunches of natural pampas grass are well-preserved and they are a stunning decoration that adds whimsy and character to any locations. Suitable for bridal bouquets, table arrangements, and fall flower arrangements. Perfect as a housewarming gift, Thanksgiving Day gift, Christmas gift, and other holiday gifts for your families and friends. [Warm Tips] Cause our tall pampas grass decor are totally natural, gentle shedding is unavoidable during transportation. Carefully shake the boho flowers to minimize the dropping seeds when they arrive at your place. Leave them in the sun for 4-5 hours or use hair dryer to obtain maximum fullness. Unlike the fresh plants, our pompas decorativas needs no maintenance. No need to water them during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vHVSiyd6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mibor","source_asin":"B0BL3H4B1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL3H4B1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL3H4B1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
