window.products.push({"id":275869,"name":"Soft Absorbent Cotton Cloth Dinner Napkins Pink Pack of 12 14 Inch x 14 Inch, 100% Long Staple Cotton Soft Sheen Sateen Hemstitched Lunch Napkins (100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UhjDHOfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REFINED LUXURY – Pizuna Cotton fabric napkins are smooth to touch and soft to use on your hands and face. They are gentle, durable and come with a subtle sheen to touch of refinement and luxury at every meal. These napkins come in assorted color shades for you to match your tablecloth and the dining room décor. They blend with modern, conventional and classic dining setups, enhancing the styling of your table. VERSATILE SIZED VALUE PACK – The Pizuna Napkin is perfectly sized at 14 inches by 14 inches so it is not too small for meals and not too large to use with drinks. They are multifunctional napkins appropriate for lunch, dinner, cocktail and even use at the bar. The 12 pc pack can cater to your needs of Small parties, get-togethers and special occasions. Impress your guests by folding these napkins into elaborate designs to transform your table. Each Value Pack has 12 napkins of 14” x 14” size. EASY CARE REUSEABLE- Simple to maintain, these soft long lasting hemstitch cloth napkins are reusable and can be machine washed multiple times in warm water. They have a special dyeing technique to retain shade even in hot washes. Wash at a high temperature (60C/140F) to reduce stains. But do not bleach, it will lead to loss of color. Iron these napkins for a brand new look and use again and again. To avoid wrinkling, dry them separately in a tumble dryer and remove when slightly moist. ECO FRIENDLY -Our Chemical free napkins set is made in BSCI compliant and OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory, an independent certification system that ensures to meet high safety standard to keep your family safe and healthy. The Oeko-Tex napkins are tested for harmful substances and certified AZO FREE as they come in close contact with the mouth. They are Non-toxic making it soothing for even the most sensitive skin. Pizuna Linens napkins are reliable and dependable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UhjDHOfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pizuna","source_asin":"B08WHKGLVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WHKGLVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WHKGLVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":275870,"name":"Gemstone Advent Calendar - 2022 Advent Calendar for Kids 24 Days Natural Crystal Gemstone Stone Minerals & Fossils Christmas Countdown Calendar Rock C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fGTdgMHzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crystal Advent Calendar 2022, Can be Opend Gift Box 24 Days Christmas Advent Calendars Rocks, Gem & Minerals & Fossils from All Over the World for Kid What's Special About Our Serum? 1、24 different ores with 24 openings, with different surprises every day, forming a lasting attraction for children. 2、A perfect independent collection or add to any kid’s specimen collection, including 18 natural mineral samples. Be a great gift for boys and girls. 3、This rock and mineral collection activity kit will attract children interested in geography and is suitable for anyone interested in geology; the ore can be used to make DIY necklaces, bracelets and other jewelry. 4、The closed packaging makes it difficult to find the internal products from the outside, which increases the interest of the child and allows the child to dig into small surprises every day. 5、Both boys and girls hope to explore the \"secrets\" in the box throughout the month. Specification: Item Name: Healing Crystal Advent Calendar Material: Stone Package includes: 1*Christmas Holiday Countdown Advent Calendars Note: The stone is not fixed style Note: ❤️Due to the difference in light and display,the color of the product is subject to the actual product. ❤️ Due to manual measurement,the product size will have an error of 0-1cm,please understand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fGTdgMHzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Géneric","source_asin":"B0BFRLH4S1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-275870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFRLH4S1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFRLH4S1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
